# Pre-Commit Quality Gate

Machine-enforced by `scripts/check-quality.sh` and `.husky/pre-commit`. Violations block commit.

## Checks (staged files)

1. No hardcoded `aria-label` / `placeholder` in JSX (use i18n `t()`)
2. No `console.log|warn|error`
3. No `as any`, `@ts-ignore`, `@ts-expect-error`
4. File size: ≤300 ok, 301–400 warn, >400 block
5. No raw axios imports (use apiClient)
6. No language ternaries (`lang === 'fr' ? …`)
7. No duplicate locale keys
8. Long functions (>25 lines) → warning
9. Python: same size/type rules on `.py` files

**Exempt:** test files, locale files, logger utility, type defs.

## Pipeline

```
1. scripts/check-quality.sh
2. type-check (project command in openos-project.mdc)
3. tests (project command in openos-project.mdc)
```

Pre-push: type-check + build (see `.husky/pre-push`).

## Bypass

`git commit --no-verify` only for emergencies. Follow with cleanup commit.

Setup hooks once: `bash scripts/setup-hooks.sh`
